mobile/android/app/src/main/assets/capacitor.plugins.json
mobile/android/capacitor-cordova-android-plugins/

# Laravel runtime. Each storage directory keeps its own .gitignore so the
# empty folders still exist after a clone.
**/storage/pail/
**/bootstrap/cache/*.php
**/.phpunit.result.cache
**/.phpunit.cache

# Editors and OS
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Database dumps are not the source of the schema
**/*.sql
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
